{
  "event_id": "community_group_023",
  "versions": {
    "427904": {
      "source": "research/p3-resting-results-293/prts-events-427904.html",
      "rows": [
        {
          "scene_key": "community_group_023:scene:0",
          "attributes": {
            "class": "scene",
            "data-etype": "■■■■",
            "id": "■■■■",
            "data-nav": "开始",
            "data-image": "Avg_pic_rogue_6_34",
            "data-name": "安眠一隅",
            "data-ename": "",
            "data-efloor": "I,II,III,IV",
            "data-index": "118",
            "data-prtsinfo": ""
          },
          "description": "不知道第几次迷失在树海中之后，你看见一只泛着橙黄色光芒的小狗从灌木中钻了出来。它晃着尾巴在你面前一蹦一跳，你跟上它的脚步，直到它消失于一棵树后。你绕着树走了一圈，依然不见它的身影，抬头发现树干上有一只像素风格的小猫，手指触碰到猫的瞬间，你感受到来自另一空间的剧烈拉扯——",
          "choices": [
            {
              "choice_key": "community_group_023:scene:0:choice:0",
              "attributes": {
                "class": "choose",
                "data-type": "collection2",
                "data-title": "进入神秘空间",
                "data-icon": "210",
                "data-dest": "1",
                "data-iconid": "rogue_6_relic_cargo_13",
                "data-subchoose": ""
              },
              "description": "获得收藏品源私钥（立刻获得99源石锭，在部分事件中能发挥特殊的作用）",
              "conditional": null,
              "subchoice_attribute_raw": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "scene_key": "community_group_023:scene:1",
          "attributes": {
            "class": "scene",
            "data-nav": "这是……",
            "data-image": "Avg_pic_rogue_6_34",
            "data-name": "安眠一隅",
            "data-ename": "",
            "data-index": "119",
            "data-prtsinfo": ""
          },
          "description": "一张被树木包围的柔软病床出现在眼前，床边的仪器屏幕如呼吸般闪烁着。阳光像细密的纺线自树冠的间隙中散落，温暖的风，甜美的果香，一切都是如此舒畅。轻快的吠声吸引了你，引领你来到此地的小狗兴奋地摇着尾巴，跳上床酣睡起来。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "choice_key": "community_group_023:scene:1:choice:0",
              "attributes": {
                "class": "choose",
                "data-type": "simple",
                "data-title": "四处看看",
                "data-icon": "unknown",
                "data-dest": "",
                "data-iconid": "",
                "data-subchoose": "小狗;2;;捕梦网;4;;松鼠;5"
              },
              "description": "也许会有其他发现",
              "conditional": "随机出现以下3种奖励中的1种",
              "subchoice_attribute_raw": "小狗;2;;捕梦网;4;;松鼠;5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "scene_key": "community_group_023:scene:2",
          "attributes": {
            "class": "scene",
            "data-nav": "希望的小狗",
            "data-image": "Avg_pic_rogue_6_34",
            "data-name": "安眠一隅",
            "data-ename": "",
            "data-index": "120",
            "data-prtsinfo": ""
          },
          "description": "你摸了摸熟睡小狗的头，它似乎做了一个美梦。梦里它的同伴们一直在等它，它晃着尾巴回到同伴身边后，便迫不及待地讲起了自己的见闻——会吃活物的树、金色的溪流、静止的蝴蝶……它的同伴们安静地听着，随后纷纷起身用舌头舔舐它的头，它所感受到的温柔，与你抚摸它时一样。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "choice_key": "community_group_023:scene:2:choice:0",
              "attributes": {
                "class": "choose",
                "data-type": "simple",
                "data-title": "抚摸小狗的脑袋",
                "data-icon": "population",
                "data-dest": "6",
                "data-iconid": "",
                "data-subchoose": ""
              },
              "description": "获得20希望",
              "conditional": null,
              "subchoice_attribute_raw": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "scene_key": "community_group_023:scene:3",
          "attributes": {
            "class": "scene",
            "data-nav": "疾驰的豹子们",
            "data-image": "Avg_pic_rogue_6_34",
            "data-name": "安眠一隅",
            "data-ename": "",
            "data-index": "121",
            "data-prtsinfo": ""
          },
          "description": "你围观了豹子们的竞速比赛，它们的终点没有猎物，它们只有对于狂奔的渴望。豹子们跑出了这片树海，甩开了身后的河流，甩开了被猎枪追逐的命运，一直没有回头。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "choice_key": "community_group_023:scene:3:choice:0",
              "attributes": {
                "class": "choose",
                "data-type": "simple",
                "data-title": "目送豹子们远去",
                "data-icon": "unknown",
                "data-dest": "8",
                "data-iconid": "",
                "data-subchoose": ""
              },
              "description": "获得1件珍贵的加工品",
              "conditional": null,
              "subchoice_attribute_raw": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "scene_key": "community_group_023:scene:4",
          "attributes": {
            "class": "scene",
            "data-nav": "安护的捕梦网",
            "data-image": "Avg_pic_rogue_6_34",
            "data-name": "安眠一隅",
            "data-ename": "",
            "data-index": "122",
            "data-prtsinfo": ""
          },
          "description": "一张捕梦网垂了下来，羽毛抚过你的脸，你听到一个女性的声音响起，为你哼唱起一首童谣，你看不见她的面容，却感到安心。\n“睡吧。”她说，“愿你的疲惫散去，愿你的心灵得到净化。”",
          "choices": [
            {
              "choice_key": "community_group_023:scene:4:choice:0",
              "attributes": {
                "class": "choose",
                "data-type": "simple",
                "data-title": "闭眼感受",
                "data-icon": "shield",
                "data-dest": "9",
                "data-iconid": "",
                "data-subchoose": ""
              },
              "description": "获得15护盾",
              "conditional": null,
              "subchoice_attribute_raw": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "scene_key": "community_group_023:scene:5",
          "attributes": {
            "class": "scene",
            "data-nav": "远行的松鼠",
            "data-image": "Avg_pic_rogue_6_34",
            "data-name": "安眠一隅",
            "data-ename": "",
            "data-index": "123",
            "data-prtsinfo": ""
          },
          "description": "“我想去看看外面的大地。”一只松鼠跳上你的肩膀，“比树上能看到的更远，比河流所至更远。我们不应停滞在此。”它的同伴一只接着一只跳上你的肩膀，你肩负起这些松鼠远大的志向，决心向着更远的地方走去。",
          "choices": [
            {
              "choice_key": "community_group_023:scene:5:choice:0",
              "attributes": {
                "class": "choose",
                "data-type": "simple",
                "data-title": "拾起松鼠落下的橡实",
                "data-icon": "unknown",
                "data-dest": "11",
                "data-iconid": "",
                "data-subchoose": ""
              },
              "description": "获得1件珍贵的加工品",
              "conditional": null,
              "subchoice_attribute_raw": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "scene_key": "community_group_023:scene:6",
          "attributes": {
            "class": "scene",
            "data-nav": "似乎……",
            "data-image": "Avg_pic_rogue_6_34",
            "data-name": "安眠一隅",
            "data-ename": "",
            "data-index": "124",
            "data-prtsinfo": ""
          },
          "description": "这里似乎曾是谁建立的疗愈室，但如今已经无人问津，或许有什么其他东西仍能使用。你在床周围的树干上又发现了同样的小猫图案——",
          "choices": [
            {
              "choice_key": "community_group_023:scene:6:choice:0",
              "attributes": {
                "class": "choose",
                "data-type": "simple",
                "data-title": "触碰图案",
                "data-icon": "unknown",
                "data-dest": "",
                "data-iconid": "",
                "data-subchoose": "果园;7;;竞速比赛;3"
              },
              "description": "尝试进入其他地方",
              "conditional": "随机出现以下2种奖励中的1种",
              "subchoice_attribute_raw": "果园;7;;竞速比赛;3"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "scene_key": "community_group_023:scene:7",
          "attributes": {
            "class": "scene",
            "data-nav": "呵护的石榴",
            "data-image": "Avg_pic_rogue_6_34",
            "data-name": "安眠一隅",
            "data-ename": "",
            "data-index": "125",
            "data-prtsinfo": ""
          },
          "description": "你来到一片果园，一颗番石榴落在你的脚边，你的同伴嘴里叼着另一颗，示意你快些捡起来吃掉。“我妈妈说，今年的番石榴很好吃。”你的同伴说，“你要不要一起来帮忙？果子就要摘不完了，全都是我们自己的，你想吃多少就吃多少。”",
          "choices": [
            {
              "choice_key": "community_group_023:scene:7:choice:0",
              "attributes": {
                "class": "choose",
                "data-type": "simple",
                "data-title": "帮忙采摘",
                "data-icon": "shield",
                "data-dest": "8",
                "data-iconid": "",
                "data-subchoose": ""
              },
              "description": "获得15护盾",
              "conditional": null,
              "subchoice_attribute_raw": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "scene_key": "community_group_023:scene:8",
          "attributes": {
            "class": "scene",
            "data-nav": "梦醒了。",
            "data-image": "Avg_pic_rogue_6_34",
            "data-name": "安眠一隅",
            "data-ename": "",
            "data-index": "126",
            "data-prtsinfo": ""
          },
          "description": "前所未有的温暖将你包裹住，但你该继续前进了。你依依不舍地看了一眼床上的小狗，离开了这个奇异的地方。",
          "choices": []
        },
